title: FightIntro
---
<<declare $friend1Name = "Branko">>
<<declare $friend2Name = "Katarina">>

<<wait 1>>

As Marc leaves the Bakery, he notices a crowd of people gathering.
They're all wearing sports jerseys and start to argue amongst each other, which leads to them pushing each other around.

{$friend1Name}: Hey {$charName}! How was your first day?
{$charName}: Pretty interesting, although I get the impression that my boss doesn't like me that much.
{$charName}: Overall, the day wasn't bad. I did have some interesting conversations.
{$charName}: You know Petar, right?
{$friend1Name}: I can't say I know Petar personally, but he always seemed grumpy.
{$charName}: I can see why you'd think that.

The crowd is getting louder and shoving has turned into throwing punches.

{$friend1Name}: Sorry, {$charName}, I have to take care of this.

{$friend1Name} runs off, right up to the fight. {$charName} doesn't even have a chance to respond.
{$charName} watches for a moment before turning to continue heading home.

{$charName}: I should head home now.
When he hurriedly walks away, he spots Katarina.
{$charName}: It's Katarina. I wonder what she's doing here? It'd be best to check on her before she gets distracted by the commotion.
The crowd of people seems to be quieting slightly - someone is probably being detained. Maybe other officers are on the scene.

{$charName}: Hey! Katarina!
{$friend2Name}: Oh, hey {$charName}, what's up?
-> Are you alright?
    <<jump KatarinaTalk>>
-> What are you doing here?
    <<jump KatarinaTalk4>>
===

title: KatarinaTalk
---
{$friend2Name}: I'm fine. Are you feeling okay?
->I'm safe, at least.
    <<jump KatarinaTalk2>>
->I'm a bit spooked.
    <<jump KatarinaTalk3>>
===

title: KatarinaTalk2
---
{$friend2Name}: Good. I was expecting this sort of stuff with the election coming up, but it's still unpredictable.
{$charName}: It's the first one in thirty years, so that makes sense.
{$friend2Name}: It's the party that wants peace versus a paramilitary group.
{$charName}: Yikes! Isn't calling them paramilitary a bit harsh?
{$charName}: When you say it like that, I get why people are so angry.
<<jump KatarinaBye>>
===

title: KatarinaTalk3
---
{$friend2Name}: Me too. Just because this sort of thing isn't rare doesn't mean it's pleasant.
{$friend2Name}: Don't worry though, I'll protect you.
{$charName}: My hero.
Katarina grins
{$friend2Name}: In that case, I'll protect you from anything that happens.
{$charName}: Thanks. I still wish people didn't get into fights so often.
Katarina frowns
{$friend2Name}: Same here.
<<jump KatarinaBye>>
===

title: KatarinaTalk4
---
{$friend2Name}: I was just heading home. I knew sports fans could get unruly, but I've never seen it in person before.
{$charName}: I think it's weird how people get so into sports...it's literally just watching people kick a ball around.
{$friend2Name}: It's never just sports. There's always politics involved, especially here.
{$charName}: Yeah, I guess you would know Ms. Star Student.
{$friend2Name}: We actually talked about this in class with my professor...sorry about that.
{$charName}: You can talk about college; I'm going eventually. Hopefully.
{$friend2Name}: I know you'll get there.
{$charName}: I just need to save up for a car.
{$charName}: My parents are just really worried with the election and all.
{$friend2Name}: It'll work out
<<jump KatarinaBye>>
===

title: KatarinaBye
---
Katarina looks worried
{$friend2Name}: Well, I can't miss the bus. Maybe I'll see you later?
{$charName}: Sure. Hopefully.
Katarina waves goodbye and exits the square.
===